hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1021","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak zamana ghoom kar usi haalat par aa gaya hai jaisa us din tha jis din Allah ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida kiya. Saal barah maheenay ka hai, un mein se chaar hurmat walay hain, teen lagatar: Zilqada, Zilhajja aur Muharram, aur Rajab jo Muzar ka maheena hai jo Jumada aur Shaban ke darmiyan hai. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun sa maheena hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jantay hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap khamosh rahay yahan tak ke ham ne samjha ke Aap usay us ke naam ke siwa kisi naam se pukarenge. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye Zilhajja nahi? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun sa shehar hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jantay hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap khamosh rahay yahan tak ke ham ne samjha ke Aap usay us ke naam ke siwa kisi naam se pukarenge. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye (Makka) shehar nahi? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun sa din hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada jantay hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap khamosh rahay yahan tak ke ham ne samjha ke Aap usay us ke naam ke siwa kisi naam se pukarenge. Aap ne farmaya: Kya ye qurbani ka din nahi? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumharay khoon aur tumharay maal, Muhammad (rawi) ne kaha: Aur mera khayal hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhari izzatein, tum par haraam hain jaisay tumharay is din ki hurmat tumharay is shehar mein tumharay is maheenay mein hai. Aur tum jald apne Rab se milo ge to Wo tum se tumharay amalon ke baaray mein poochay ga, to mere baad gumrah ho kar na palatna ke tum mein se baaz baaz ki gardanain maartay hon. Khabardar! Haazir ghaib ko pahunchaye, shayad jinhein ye (baat) pahunchayi jaye un mein se baaz usay sun-nay walon mein se baaz se zyada yaad rakhnay walay hon. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Khabardar! Kya main ne pahuncha diya? (Muslim: 5/107). Baab: Qayamat ke din sab se pehle khoonon mein faisla."
"1022","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din logon ke darmiyan sab se pehle khoonon mein faisla kiya jaye ga. (Muslim: 5/107). (Zamana se murad saal hai; ghoomnay ka matlab us haalat ki taraf lautna hai jis par Allah ne maheenon ko aasmanon aur zameen ki paidaish ke din rakha tha; Arab hurmat walay maheenon ko aagay peechay kar detay thay jisay nasi kehtay hain; Rajab ko Muzar ki taraf is liye mansoob kiya ke wo us ki bohat tazeem kartay thay.)"
"1023","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman mard ka khoon halal nahi jo gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur ke main Allah ka Rasool hun siwae teen mein se aik ke: Shaadi shuda zanikaar, jaan ke badlay jaan, aur apne deen ko chhornay wala jamaat se juda honay wala. (Muslim: 5/106). Baab: Us ke baaray mein hukm jo Islam se phir jaye aur qatl karay aur jang karay. (Nuskhon mein Zaani baghair ya ke hai jo sahi lughat hai.)"
"1024","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ukl qabeelay ke aath afraad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur unhon ne Aap se Islam par bai'at ki, phir Madina ki aab-o-hawa unhein raas na aayi aur un ke jism beemar ho gaye, to unhon ne ye baat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se shikayat ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum hamaray charwahay ke saath oonton mein nahi nikaltay aur un ke peshab aur un ke doodh se faida uthatay? To unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Phir wo niklay aur un ke peshab aur doodh se piya to tandrust ho gaye, phir unhon ne charwahay ko qatl kar diya aur oont hank kar le gaye. To ye baat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pahunchi to Aap ne un ke peechay (aadmi) bhejay, to wo pakray gaye aur laye gaye, to Aap ne un ke baaray mein hukm diya to un ke haath aur paon kaat diye gaye aur un ki aankhein garam salai se phor di gayeen, phir unhein dhoop mein daal diya gaya yahan tak ke wo mar gaye. (Muslim: 5/101-102). Baab: Us ka gunah jo qatl ki rasm daalay. (Unhon ne Madina ki zameen ko bhaari paya; aankhein phornay ko samar aur samal bhi kehtay hain.)"
"1025","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi jaan zulm se qatl nahi ki jati magar us ke khoon mein se aik hissa Adam ke pehlay betay (Qabeel) par hai, kyunke wo sab se pehla tha jis ne qatl ki rasm daali. (Muslim: 5/107). Baab: Jo apni jaan ko kisi cheez se maaray to usi se aag mein azaab diya jaye ga. (Kifl se murad hissa hai.)"
"1026","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apni jaan ko lohay se maaray to us ka loha us ke haath mein hoga jisay wo Jahannam ki aag mein apne pait mein ghonpta rahay ga, hamesha hamesha us mein rehnay wala, aur jo zehar pi kar apni jaan maaray to wo Jahannam ki aag mein usay ghoont ghoont pi raha hoga, hamesha hamesha us mein rehnay wala, aur jo pahaar se gir kar apni jaan maaray to wo Jahannam ki aag mein girta rahay ga, hamesha hamesha us mein rehnay wala. (Muslim: 1/72). (Yatawajja se murad waar karna hai.)"
"1027","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mushrikon se aamnay saamnay hue aur laraayi hui, phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne lashkar ki taraf lautay aur doosray apne lashkar ki taraf lautay, aur Rasoolullah ke sahaba mein aik aadmi tha jo un (dushmanon) mein se kisi choti ya bari jamaat ko nahi chhorta magar us ka talwaar se peecha karta, to unhon ne kaha: Aaj ham mein se kisi ne itna kaam nahi kiya jitna falan ne kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Beshak wo dozakhiyon mein se hai. To qaum mein se aik mard ne kaha: Main hamesha us ke saath rahun ga. Unhon ne kaha: To wo us ke saath nikla, jab wo theharta to wo us ke saath theharta aur jab wo tez chalta to wo us ke saath tez chalta. Unhon ne kaha: To wo aadmi sakht zakhmi ho gaya to us ne maut mein jaldi ki, phir us ne apni talwaar ka dastah zameen par rakha aur us ki nok apne seenay ke darmiyan rakhi, phir apne aap ko talwaar par gira diya aur apni jaan maar li. To wo mard Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Aap Allah ke Rasool hain. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya? Unhon ne kaha: Wo aadmi jis ka Aap ne abhi zikr kiya tha ke wo dozakhiyon mein se hai to logon ne isay bari baat samjha, to main ne kaha: Main tumharay liye us (ki khabar) lata hun. To main us ki talaash mein nikla yahan tak ke wo sakht zakhmi ho gaya, to us ne maut mein jaldi ki, phir us ne apni talwaar ka dastah zameen par rakha aur us ki nok apne seenay ke darmiyan rakhi, phir us par gir kar apni jaan maar li. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Beshak aadmi jannatiyon ke amal kartay hain logon ko zaahir honay mein jabke wo dozakhiyon mein se hota hai, aur beshak aadmi dozakhiyon ke amal karta hai logon ko zaahir honay mein jabke wo jannatiyon mein se hota hai. (Muslim: 1/74). Baab: Jo pathar se maaray to usi se maara jaye."
"1028","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik londi payi gayi jis ka sar do patharon ke darmiyan kuchal diya gaya tha, to unhon ne us se poocha: Tumharay saath ye kis ne kiya, falan ne, falan ne, yahan tak ke unhon ne aik Yahudi ka naam liya to us ne apne sar se ishara kiya. To Yahudi ko pakra gaya to us ne iqraar kar liya, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ke baaray mein hukm diya ke us ka sar patharon se kuchal diya jaye. (Muslim: 5/104). Baab: Jo kisi mard ka haath kaatay aur wo apna samnay ka daant khenchnay par nikal le."
"1029","[AI-translation] Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik mard ne aik mard ka haath kaat liya to us ne apna haath kheench liya to us ka samnay ka daant ya us ke daant gir gaye, to us ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se insaf manga. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mujhe kya hukm detay ho, kya tum mujhe hukm detay ho ke main usay hukm dun ke wo apna haath tumharay munh mein chhoray rakhay taake tum usay chabao jaisay oont chabata hai? Apna haath aagay badhao taake wo usay kaatay phir usay kheench lo. (Muslim: 5/105). (Is se murad usay aisa karnay ka hukm dena nahi balke us par inkar hai; Muslim ki aik riwayat mein izafa hai ke Aap ne us (daaway) ko baatil kar diya aur farmaya: Us ke liye koi diyyat nahi.)"
"1030","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rubayyi ki behan Umm Harisa ne aik insan ko zakhmi kar diya to wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas muqadma le kar aaye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qisas, qisas. To Umm Rabi ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kya falan aurat se qisas liya jaye ga? Allah ki qasam us se qisas na liya jaye ga. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: SubhanAllah! Ae Umm Rabi! Qisas Allah ki kitab ka (hukm) hai. Unhon ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam us se kabhi qisas na liya jaye ga. Unhon ne kaha: To wo musalsal (sifarish karti) rahin yahan tak ke unhon ne diyyat qabool kar li. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ke bandon mein se koi aisa hai ke agar wo Allah par qasam khaye to Allah usay poora kar deta hai. (Muslim: 5/105-106). Baab: Jo qatl ka iqraar karay aur wali ke hawalay kiya jaye aur wo muaf kar de. (Un ka maqsad Nabi ke hukm ko radd karna na tha balke muafi ki sifarish thi.)"
"1031","[AI-translation] Alqama bin Wail se, un ke walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Beshak main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath baitha hua tha ke aik mard aaya jo doosray ko chamray ki rassi se kheench raha tha. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Is ne mere bhai ko qatl kiya hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne usay qatl kiya? To us ne (iqraar kiya), (rawi ne wali-e-qatl ka qaul darmiyan mein daakhil kiya ke) beshak agar wo iqraar na karta to main us par gawah qaim karta. Us ne kaha: Haan, main ne usay qatl kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne usay kaisay qatl kiya? Us ne kaha: Main aur wo aik darakht se pattay jhaar rahay thay, to us ne mujhe gaali di aur mujhe ghussa dilaya, to main ne kulhaari us ke sar ke kinaray par maari aur usay qatl kar diya. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tumharay paas koi cheez hai jo tum apni taraf se ada karo? Us ne kaha: Mere paas meri chadar aur meri kulhaari ke siwa koi maal nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum samajhtay ho ke tumhari qaum tumhein khareed le gi? Us ne kaha: Main apni qaum par us se bhi zyada haqeer hun. To Aap ne us ki taraf us ki rassi phenki aur farmaya: Apne saathi ko le lo. To wo mard usay le kar chala, phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar wo usay qatl karay to wo usi jaisa hai. To wo wapas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo usay qatl karay to wo usi jaisa hai, aur main ne usay Aap ke hukm se pakra tha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi chahtay ke wo tumharay gunah aur tumharay saathi ke gunah ko uthaye? Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Nabi! Shayad aisa ho. Aap ne farmaya: Kyun nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Beshak aisa hi hai. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne apni rassi phenk di aur usay chhor diya. (Muslim: 5/109). (Qatl karay to usi jaisa hai ka matlab hai ke donon mein se kisi ko doosray par koi fazilat ya ehsaan na hoga.)"
"1032","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Huzail ki do aurtein larin to un mein se aik ne doosri ko pathar maara aur usay aur jo us ke pait mein tha usay qatl kar diya. To wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas muqadma le kar aaye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne faisla kiya ke us ke janeen ki diyyat aik ghulam ya londi hai aur aurat ki diyyat ka faisla us ki aaqila (qabeelay walon) par kiya aur us (maqtula) ka waris us ka beta aur jo un ke saath thay unhein banaya. To Haml bin Nabigha Huzali ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main us ka jurmana kaisay dun jo na piya, na khaya, na bola aur na roya, to aisa (khoon) zaya hai? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai, us ke saja band kalam ki wajah se jo us ne kaha. (Muslim: 5/110). Baab: Wo nuqsan jis mein koi diyyat nahi. (Ghurra se murad ghulam ya londi hai; aaqila se murad baap ki taraf se rishtadar hain; yatullu se murad zaya hona hai.)"
"1033","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Kuwen ka nuqsan zaya hai, kaan ka nuqsan zaya hai, aur bezuban janwar ka nuqsan zaya hai, aur dafeenay mein panchwan (hissa zakat) hai. (Muslim: 5/128). (Jubaar se murad zaya hai jis ka koi tawan nahi; rikaz se murad zamanay jahiliyat ka dafan shuda khazana hai.)"
